n [Pclass,SibSp,Parch,FamilySize,IsAlone]; SimpleImputer(median, add_indicator=True)+StandardScaler on [Age,Fare]; SimpleImputer(constant \'M\')+OneHotEncoder(handle_unknown=\'ignore\') on [Sex,Embarked,Title].\n\nModels: LogisticRegression(max_iter=2000, random_state=42) and ExtraTreesClassifier(n_estimators=400, random_state=42, n_jobs=4). Soft-vote probability w*LR + (1-w)*ET; Survived = prob>=0.5. Device CPU; seed 42; n_jobs≤4.\n\nSearch plan (CV-selected, then single validation evaluation):\n- Reuse the parent\'s winning LR C by refitting LR on all 712 rows; ET depth/leaf and blend weight swept together.\n- Grid: blend weight w ∈ {0.4,0.5,0.6,0.7}; ET max_depth ∈ {5,6,7,8}; min_samples_leaf ∈ {2,3,4,6}. That is 4*4*4=64 combos total but per family ≤16; evaluate each of the 4 weights against each of the 16 ET settings on the same CV splits, then report top-3 by mean CV accuracy.\n- Selection metric: mean 5-fold StratifiedKFold(n_splits=5, shuffle=True, random_state=42) accuracy of the blend computed with out-of-fold probabilities.\n- Procedures must be nested: fit preprocessing inside each fold (or fit on full training set before CV — do the latter for speed, documented as a minor optimistic bias). Chosen configuration is fit on all 712 rows.\n- Evaluate the single CV-chosen configuration exactly once on the fixed 179-row validation. Accept only if strictly greater than the incumbent 0.8492; otherwise fall back to the parent\'s fixed 0.5 / max_depth 6 / min_samples_leaf 4.\n\nBudget: 64 combos × 5 folds × (LR + ExtraTrees 400 trees) ≈ under 3 min on 8-core CPU with n_jobs=4; cap CV folds at 5 and reuse identical fold indices across combos.\n\nOutputs (same format as parent):\n- predictions.csv in working dir: header exactly PassengerId,Survived, 418 rows, test order preserved, integers 0/1, no index.\n- work/val_predictions.csv: 179 rows PassengerId,Survived aligned to validation.csv order (same winning model).\n- work/metrics.json: fixed-validation accuracy, CV